le; guards must be comparisons, memberships, or boolean combinations t
hereof over constant arguments, parameters, and loop variables
guardbad.tlsf:12.14: definition 'gor' guard is not statically decidabl
e; guards must be comparisons, memberships, or boolean combinations th
ereof over constant arguments, parameters, and loop variables
conversion of guardbad.tlsf failed
folded.tlsf:16.5-13: integer literal in LTL position
